Yes, you should wear it. No other armor is going to perform as well from a
pure-AC standpoint, and the magic resistance is always great...you need no
longer fear poly/teleport traps among other things.

As an Arc, it isn't long-term armor, since your quest artifact gives magic
resistance from inventory, but it is great for now. If you've identified
some remove curse scrolls already, then WIELD the armor and read the
scroll, which will uncurse it. Otherwise, just put it on...not being able
to take it off really isn't such a big deal. By the time you need to,
you'll be able to uncurse.

Hell, if nothing else, find a fountain and #dip some less useful potions to
make plain water and do a water prayer in minetown.


